2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"me3mlZsR26fV89fMw2uR6Q","review_id":"MAwVbjR6rRHi4KIdFI06yw","date":"2013-01-14T23:26:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.936576247215271,"text_excerpt":"Seriously good food and service: The Rib Room is as good as it gets. We went there for Saturday lunch around Noon and enjoyed the best service I've had in New Orleans and some of the best food I've lately. Every food we tried was really geat but they're known for the Prime Rib and for very good reason. It's great. I have to say, though: I thought the cheesecake was just ok. The bottom, chocolate layer really over-powered the taste of cheesecake for me. I mean, it was still good, just not \"cheese-cakie\" enough for me. The bread pudding, however, was delicious. The price was fine for the quality of the food and service and I'll definitely go back."},{"business_id":"me3mlZsR26fV89fMw2uR6Q","review_id":"_g7ukxOoLHGhhmXDIY1kDg","date":"2017-06-13T03:25:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9353795051574707,"text_excerpt":"While staying at the Omni Royal I came across the Rib Room. I was traveling to New Orleans for the first time. When I arrived the weather was horrible and pouring down rain, so I decided to hit up the restaurant/bar at the hotel to start getting my drink and eat on. :) I was traveling solo so I love sitting at the bar and eating. It's a great way to chat with the bartenders and other people at the bar. Dee'Aundra was the bartender and was fantastic! She was so friendly and easy to talk to. She gave me recommendations on New Orleans which I greatly appreciated. She recommended the Fried P&J Oysters Pastis (Creamed Spinach, Feta Cheese and Roasted Red Peppers) on the appetizer menu. They we..."},{"business_id":"me3mlZsR26fV89fMw2uR6Q","review_id":"mZpDQapt-cASZOADDnckOw","date":"2012-09-03T16:49:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9348933696746826,"text_excerpt":"Rib room is old school elegant N'awlins in the heart of the French quarter. We were here for brunch during Southern Decadence and caught quite an eye-full through their large glass windows. The place is gorgeous inside, and the food is top notch. Fried oysters, salmon, prime rib, Sardou, and excellent deserts. Everything seemed to be first rate, and the service was also outstanding. Plenty of champagne and food for an army. Expect to leave hating yourself for the over-indulgence though! Lead us not into temptation. Deliver me from the table."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"me3mlZsR26fV89fMw2uR6Q","photo_id":"4BM4HEgb8vKnjtx1P1J4wg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/4BM4HEgb8vKnjtx1P1J4wg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8892592191696167},{"business_id":"me3mlZsR26fV89fMw2uR6Q","photo_id":"k1vWEryfjKWoHT86l4Raow","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/k1vWEryfjKWoHT86l4Raow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8273197412490845},{"business_id":"me3mlZsR26fV89fMw2uR6Q","photo_id":"6rx2Bvlix3IQAuxFQSQAvw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6rx2Bvlix3IQAuxFQSQAvw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8078687191009521},{"business_id":"me3mlZsR26fV89fMw2uR6Q","photo_id":"DOql-Jyv0EREFlmzuHgA9Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/DOql